Challenges we face in Machine Learning - 

-Having a huge data that needs to be trained
-Out of Memory
-Data Collection - API , Webscraping , CSV and JSON/SQL
-Insufficient Data
-Non Representative Data , basically it is the hidden data or partial data that was not used at the time of training and was required 
as the algorithm didn't included it
-Poor Quality Data
-Irrelevant Features
-Overfitting/Underfitting
-Software Integration - The Final product is valuabe for users or not
-Offline Learning / Development
-Cost Involved 
